      text: "The capstone: a full personal page using everything from the track. The spec: a semantic skeleton (header with nav, main, footer), a heading structure (one h1, h2 sections), at least one image with real alt text, a list of skills, a table of projects, a contact form (with labeled inputs), and a full head (charset, viewport, title, description). Bonus: internal links (#sections) and one external link in a new tab. Validate it before calling it done.",
      def: "A personal page combining: semantic structure, correct heading order, images with alt, lists, a table, a labeled form, and a complete <head> — validated clean.",
      code: "SPEC (your checklist):\n[ ] <!doctype> + <html lang>\n[ ] <head>: charset, viewport,\n    title, description\n[ ] <header> with <nav>\n[ ] one <h1>, <h2> per section\n[ ] <main> wrapping content\n[ ] image with meaningful alt\n[ ] skills as <ul>\n[ ] projects as <table>\n[ ] contact form: labels + ids\n[ ] <footer>\n[ ] validated: 0 errors\n\nBuild it, then validate.\nThis is the HTML track, done.",
      out: { web: { h: "<header style=\"background:#14171f;color:#fff;padding:14px 18px\"><b style=\"color:#f5b23d\">Ada L.</b> <span style=\"float:right;font-size:12px\"><a href=\"#work\" style=\"color:#ccc\">Work</a> · <a href=\"#contact\" style=\"color:#ccc\">Contact</a></span></header><main style=\"padding:18px\"><h2 id=\"work\" style=\"color:#b3543c\">Work</h2><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px\"><tr style=\"background:#f4f2ea\"><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:6px\">Project</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:6px\">Stack</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border-top:1px solid #eee\">Portfolio</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border-top:1px solid #eee\">HTML/CSS</td></tr></table><h2 id=\"contact\" style=\"color:#b3543c;margin-top:18px\">Contact</h2><p style=\"font-size:13px\">Form with labeled inputs — the full page has charset, viewport, title, description.</p></main><footer style=\"padding:12px 18px;background:#f4f2ea;font-size:11px;color:#888\">Built with the HTML track.</footer>", c: "body{font-family:sans-serif;background:#faf7f0;color:#222;margin:0;max-width:520px}", j: "" } },
