      task: "Build the page from the spec above — for real, in your own words. Then run it through the W3C validator and fix every error. Screenshot the clean validation report; that's your proof of completion.",
      mistake: "Skipping the <head> details (viewport, description) because they're invisible — but they're what make the page work on phones and appear in search. Invisible is not unimportant.",
